  {
   "id": "01676A",
   "fmt": "plain",
   "jp": "俺は俺は…銀河を…この 銀河を統一するまでは… うおおおお…{end}",
   "en": "I... I... the galaxy...{n}until I unify this{n}galaxy... Uoooooh...{end}",
   "max": 62,
   "ptr": [
    "p16 016706"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "0167A8",
   "fmt": "plain",
   "jp": "す すまねえな…みんな…俺は一足先に あの世へ 行かせてもらうぜ…!{end}",
   "en": "S-sorry, all... Looks{n}like I'm headin' to the{n}next world first...!{end}",
   "max": 70,
   "ptr": [
    "p16 016710"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "0167EE",
   "fmt": "plain",
   "jp": "俺 俺が負けるだと?! くっ…!! 俺の力もここまでか…!!{end}",
   "en": "Me? I lost?! Ngh...!! Is{n}this all I had in{n}me...!!{end}",
   "max": 62,
   "ptr": [
    "p16 016712"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "01682C",
   "fmt": "plain",
   "jp": "私の能力も ここまで…!銀河統一の日を 見てみたかった……{end}",
   "en": "So this is my limit...!{n}I wanted to see the day{n}the galaxy united...{end}",
   "max": 60,
   "ptr": [
    "p16 016716"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "016868",
   "fmt": "plain",
   "jp": "みなさん…ごめんなさい…先立つことを… 許して ください…{end}",
   "en": "Everyone... I'm sorry...{n}Please forgive me for{n}going first...{end}",
   "max": 60,
   "ptr": [
    "p16 016718"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "0168A4",
   "fmt": "plain",
   "jp": "う うちは死ぬんか?  うちはまだ…うちは…!{end}",
   "en": "A-am I dyin'? I still...{n}I...!{end}",
   "max": 48,
   "ptr": [
    "p16 01671A"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "0168D4",
   "fmt": "plain",
   "jp": "くっそおおお!俺はこんな所で終わっちまうのか? うおおおお…!!{end}",
   "en": "Damn iiit! Am I gonna{n}end in a place like{n}this? Uoooooh...!!{end}",
   "max": 66,
   "ptr": [
    "p16 01671C"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "016916",
   "fmt": "plain",
   "jp": "俺の専は…俺の思うよりもはるか遠くにあったか… 専の散る時…命も散る…{end}",
   "en": "My dream was farther{n}than I knew... With it{n}falls my life...{end}",
   "max": 72,
   "ptr": [
    "p16 01671E"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "01695E",
   "fmt": "plain",
   "jp": "ふはははははは…!!  ふはっふはっふはははは…死ぬぞ死ぬぞ…俺が!!{end}",
   "en": "Fuhahahahaha...!! Fuha,{n}fuha, fuhahaha... I die,{n}I die... me!!{end}",
   "max": 72,
   "ptr": [
    "p16 016720"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "0169A6",
   "fmt": "plain",
   "jp": "わしも ここまでか…{end}",
   "en": "So this is my end too...{end}",
   "max": 22,
   "ptr": [
    "p16 016724"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "0169BC",
   "fmt": "plain",
   "jp": "あたしまだ死にたくない!やだったら いやだっ!!死にたくないよ～!!{end}",
   "en": "I don't wanna die yet!{n}No, no, no!! I don't{n}wanna die!!{end}",
   "max": 70,
   "ptr": [
    "p16 01672C"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "016A02",
   "fmt": "plain",
   "jp": "智による全銀河の統一も ついには専と消えたか…!…それも良かろう…!{end}",
   "en": "So a galaxy united by{n}Chi was only a dream...!{n}...That is fine too...!{end}",
   "max": 70,
   "ptr": [
